<title>USA: Registry files for 3 million common shares.</title>
<headline>Registry files for 3 million common shares.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Registry Inc said on Friday that it filed a registration statement with the Securities and Exchange Commission to sell up to three million common shares.</p>
<p>Of the total, 1,234,166 common shares are being offered by the company and 1,765,834 common are being sold by selling shareholders, the filing said.</p>
